### 创建个人知识库
POST {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/base/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "期末复习",
  "type": 1,
  "description": "高数与线代资料"
}

### 创建共享知识库
POST {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/base/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "课题组资料",
  "type": 2,
  "description": "论文与实验记录"
}

### 删除知识库（默认知识库会被拒绝）
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/base/delete?id=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 获取知识库详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/base/get?id=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 分页查询知识库
GET {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/base/page?pageNum=1&pageSize=10&type=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
